<title>NETHERLANDS: Dresdner Kl. rates Ballast Nedam a Buy.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Kl. rates Ballast Nedam a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (04/07)</p>
<p>Company--------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Ballast Nedam  construction  104.00  Dresdner Kleinwort Benson</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy</p>
<p>Company's strategy of focusing more on Europe has greatly improved risk profile. European construction business should see margin recovery and company has secured its lucrative position in the Middle East. Ballast Nedam shares currently trade at 48 percent discount to the Dutch market and 21 percent discount to Dutch construction sector. We rate the stock a Buy and have set a 12-months price target of 125 guilders.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     9.15    11.5   6.5    4.50</p>
<p>    1997		  9.80    10.6   6.0    4.80</p>
<p>    1998		 10.70     9.7   5.5    5.20</p>
